# Battery E: the higher-order tax

## E. Higher-order tax (depth 2)

Every cell carries the same list plumbing; only the HOF and its hole-fill policy move.
`none` is the control: it shows what a HOF costs when its holes can never be filled.
`synth, grounded` re-runs lambda-synthesis with `unpinned_type_var_mode` relaxed, which
is the only cell where `map`'s free hole return type can be resolved at all.

cell                        leaves   considered  x base    secs   r1 pred   r1 real                    per round  flags
plumbing only (no HOF)          15           47    1.0x     0.0         4         4                      15,4,28  
+ map @ none                    15           47    1.0x     0.0         4         4                      15,4,28  
+ map @ point-free              15           68    1.4x     0.0         4         8                      20,8,40  r1 prediction MISSED
+ map @ lambda-synthesis        15           68    1.4x     0.0         4         8                      20,8,40  r1 prediction MISSED
+ map @ synth, grounded         15          102    2.2x     0.0         4         8                      20,8,45  r1 prediction MISSED
+ filter @ none                 17           49    1.0x     0.0         4         4                      17,4,28  
+ filter @ point-free           17           70    1.5x     0.0         4         8                      22,8,40  r1 prediction MISSED
+ filter @ lambda-synthesis      17          103    2.2x     0.0         4         8                      22,8,42  r1 prediction MISSED
+ filter @ synth, grounded      17          103    2.2x     0.0         4         8                      22,8,42  r1 prediction MISSED
+ fold @ none                   15           47    1.0x     0.0         4         4                      15,4,28  
+ fold @ point-free             15           68    1.4x     0.0         4         8                      20,8,40  r1 prediction MISSED
+ fold @ lambda-synthesis       15          981   20.9x     0.1         4         8                     20,8,203  r1 prediction MISSED
+ fold @ synth, grounded        15          981   20.9x     0.1         4         8                     20,8,203  r1 prediction MISSED

